\part[2] Find the value of $p$.
\part[2] Hence, find the value of $\mathrm{E}(X)$.
A second biased four-sided die, $\mathrm{B}$, is rolled. Let $Y$ be the score obtained when die B is rolled. The probability distribution for $Y$ is given in the following table.
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|c|l|l|l|l|}
\hline$y$ & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\
